  "hypothesis": "verify_run is a purely INTERNAL consistency predicate: it detects 100% of non-recomputing mutations but 0% of consistent re-forges, because a consistent re-forge is bit-indistinguishable from an honest write to any predicate computed solely from the archive. Tamper-evidence therefore requires an anchor held outside the archive, root_hash is the unique single provenance field whose retention detects every re-forge, and a DSSE Ed25519 attestation supplies that anchor in-band only under cold key custody (Haber-Stornetta 1991 witnessing requirement; RFC 6962 Signed Tree Head; Crosby-Wallach 2009).",
  "module": "amphora-run-provenance",
